# PR rollup — ask, then only if they say yes

When this repo has **two or more open, unmerged** agent PRs that are ready
(draft or open, not abandoned), ask whether to roll them up. Example:

> Would you like to roll up PRs 61, 62 into a new PR?

## Do

- List the PR numbers and one-line titles
- Wait for an explicit yes (“roll them up”, “combine 61 and 62”)
- If yes: one new branch from latest `main`, cherry-pick or merge those
  branches, one new PR, say which sources landed

## Do not

- Do not roll up unless they said yes
- Do not include superseded or already-merged PRs (e.g. an older plugin
  upgrade that a later production PR already contains)
- Do not treat this as a commit/push permission question — that is a
  different rule
